[style name="FAA Style"]
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/icebergvillage.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
audio music "res://game/audio/music/green-rain.ogg" [loop="true"]
narrator: It was a sunny day in Iceberg Village.
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/beansleep.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: A young penguin named Bean was dozing off in his bed.
narrator: Until suddenly...
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/beanirs.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: Bean was suddenly taken by the IRS!
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/mayor.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: Apparently he'd been behind on his tax debts!
narrator: Thankfully, the Mayor allowed him to handle his tax debt in installments. Something about being familiar with one of his relatives.\
[pause=0.75][font_size=12]Nepotism goes crazy in Iceberg Village.[/font_size]
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/beanfishing.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: In order to pay off his debts, Bean decided to go fishing in order to pay off his debts.
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/beanfishing2.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: In the past, his grandfather used to take Bean fishing, although that was a long time ago.
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/hyperfish.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: Unfortunately nowadays, fishing around Iceberg Village can be pretty difficult. They were frankly too energetic to catch! [pause=0.75]\
[font_size=12]Guess the fish discovered steroids or something.[/font_size]
[background arg="res://game/Dialogic/images/grandpanote.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
narrator: Thinking he was out of luck, he found something his grandpa left him.
do GameController.start_game()